    {
      "name": "media_upload_video",
      "description": "Upload an MP4/MOV (max 200 MB) for a product from a local path or URL, optionally with a poster image, and publish it (status ready). A video always belongs to at least one product (product_id); product_ids links further products that are shown next to the video in the shop's video feed. Creator Free: 5 ready videos per shop.",
